    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γειτνί-ᾱσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γειτονία</span>
			, <i>neighbourhood, proximity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				672b28
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a neighbourhood, district</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				483.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				32
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.475
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβαρικαὶ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Per.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>proximity, resemblance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν γ. καὶ ὁμοιότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EE</u>
					1232a21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1257a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				12.2.9
			</span></i>.</div>
